# Clash / Mihomo application-level DIRECT rules.
# Keep these above broad domain/category proxy rules in the consuming profile.

# WorkBuddy (Tencent) — force the desktop app and its bundled helpers DIRECT.
PROCESS-NAME,WorkBuddy.exe
PROCESS-PATH-REGEX,(?i)^C:\\Users\\[^\\]+\\AppData\\Local\\Programs\\WorkBuddy\\.*
PROCESS-PATH-REGEX,(?i)^C:\\Users\\[^\\]+\\\.workbuddy\\.*
